      "at": "06-government-legal/un-udhr/udhr-sna.txt#4811-4944",
      "ref": "06-government-legal/un-udhr/udhr-sna.txt",
      "text": "(Chechipiri) - Hapana munhu anofanirwa kunzi anemhosva pamutemo wenyika kana mutemo wenyika dzepasi pose, panguva yechiitiko ichocho."
     },
     {
      "at": "06-government-legal/un-udhr/udhr-sna.txt#6241-6351",
